<description>&lt;p&gt;A machete-wielding mob killed a nurse and wounded a health worker while they responded to an Ebola alert in eastern DRC, prompting Uganda to tighten its border as the outbreak spread. Rebel forces captured weapons from fleeing DRC troops and Burundian troops, while DRC forces recaptured strategic territory from a rebel group led by an ex-president. Nigerian President Tinubu called for stronger African defence cooperation as the death toll from a separate attack in Taraba rose to 58. The conflict produced 1,158 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sky News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxOZ09fX1dBT200aVBYSWJ0ZDBndWQyWlA2RkVuclhtMEs0dlpFemtoTGpmWVFxREh2MXZWT29fSnhyUks5TXlyaXhEdW9jVjhlS2tWYkZ1Z2QyQS1aaU9FaEFLakoxQ3RCMzltb2xldkJ4UzNDRWRKM21VWXgtSXp2UlhDbkM1Vkx1emhmajZScWVHUkVmM0tMejZnTUhqV3NNY1BqS0hKem9tUDFyeU1lMGJ0VWY?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTFA0UHltUWxpb2RGV3hhRTZzdXRKLXZlcktvOE5ZeE1nX0JNaGF0Nm92bzlFamI1TlJGWXlNRjdPWkh6UXZuNTN1Z3BNeHlfYnI1SzB2OEpFMA?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE5OMkE2ckFEdi04enBjZXVsekphLTVqVkRacVdKMzhuQ1RrNHByZjFOOEkxbEd5akFXUVdlV1hnWkRaN056RHRuRUtQYUIwYVk0Q1pqTFRuVUI5WXV3cEE?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxOU1RPZS10RDhMR2xCVTc1WlBuOFB3MDNrNVY0VWM2RDNFTHJrR2phXzZUZFpQUjY2aEhCSmZQOEtKYTNkUE80ZmYtNVhMM21LRXhWc1l2WkY3SnJnZlNFQ0tGenpqd0YwMjFpdTJZSElFSXItUFpGblFJaUpqNFRBSlM5Y0ZEUVk2Wjk0aXBraEx0UzNRTHc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Taarifa Rwanda&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBM